{
  "id": "E203",
  "title": "My Computer is Broken",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2018-03-24",
  "synopsis": "Yuanyuan's computer is broken and she asks her colleague to help her.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/690/8f103ec250cab1e3b1daf3c2cd3c191590b38b52.mp3?1521037908",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我的电脑坏了\n\n圆圆：方方，我的电脑好像坏了，你帮我看看吧？\n方方：我也不知道是什么问题。杰杰，你能过来一下吗？\n杰杰：什么事？\n方方：圆圆的电脑坏了，你能帮她看一下是什么问题吗？\n杰杰：好的，马上就来。",
    "traditional": "我的電腦壞了\n\n圓圓：方方，我的電腦好像壞了，你幫我看看吧？\n方方：我也不知道是什麼問題。杰杰，你能過來一下嗎？\n杰杰：什麼事？\n方方：圓圓的電腦壞了，你能幫她看一下是什麼問題嗎？\n杰杰：好的，馬上就來。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "My Computer is Broken"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "圆圆：方方，我的电脑好像坏了，你帮我看看吧？",
      "traditional": "圓圓：方方，我的電腦好像壞了，你幫我看看吧？",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán fāng fāng wǒ de diàn nǎo hǎo xiàng huài le nǐ bāng wǒ kàn kan ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: Fangfang, it seems like my computer is broken. Could you help me to take a look?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "方方：我也不知道是什么问题。杰杰，你能过来一下吗？",
      "traditional": "方方：我也不知道是什麼問題。杰杰，你能過來一下嗎？",
      "pinyin": "fāng fāng wǒ yě bù zhī dào shì shén me wèn tí jié jié nǐ néng guò lái yí xià ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fangfang: I don't know what the problem is either. Jay, could you come here?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "杰杰：什么事？",
      "traditional": "杰杰：什麼事？",
      "pinyin": "jié jié shén me shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jay: What's up?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "方方：圆圆的电脑坏了，你能帮她看一下是什么问题吗？",
      "traditional": "方方：圓圓的電腦壞了，你能幫她看一下是什麼問題嗎？",
      "pinyin": "fāng fāng yuán yuán de diàn nǎo huài le nǐ néng bāng tā kàn yí xià shì shén me wèn tí ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fangfang: Yuanyuan's computer is broken. Could you help check what the problem is?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "杰杰：好的，马上就来。",
      "traditional": "杰杰：好的，馬上就來。",
      "pinyin": "jié jié hǎo de mǎ shàng jiù lái",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jay: Ok, I’ll be there soon."
    }
  ],
